= Zentrum undergoes switch of priorities.

Following the victory ofPrelate Ludwig Kaas, compromise candidate between the left and right, has been shifting party to the right, turning it away from commitment to the repubic towards the vague catholic oriented policies, even as far as showing authoritarian tendencies and willingless to dismantle the democracy if time has arrived.

With the unofficial **Weimar Divorce**, SPD [? if ddp_votes > 0: and possibly [+ ddp_name +] ?] are the sole parties to still be loyal to republican order. Our time has come.

- @root: Perhaps, Zentrum were never committed to the democracy to begin with?
